{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Preserve the released invocation-end ordering contract.** The base API documented plugins as running in registration order, so reversing existing end hooks can break cleanup dependencies and per-invocation state during a patch upgrade. Keep forward order for legacy plugins and introduce an explicit/versioned LIFO opt-in for scope-owning plugins, with mixed-order compatibility tests.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc774TCc","finding_digest":"6a6a364423079980f182e8d5380ffe41cbf54169c4fd16e9b84450553a2a3bdc","finding_id":"arf_v1_njvdmrbda6myb4mc5dktqd76ih","finding_key":"sdk/pluginrunner::oninvocationend::registration-order-compatibility","identity_key":"sdk/pluginrunner::oninvocationend::registration-order-compatibility","line":110,"observation_digest":"805a1b9e42a1b9c55df58281351fa0499070db6f5ea14833c2c87a3721ba1b84","observation_id":"aro_v1_qbnbxhscug44kxpvqkatkh5ajg","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/plugin/PluginRunner.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_njvdmrbda6myb4mc5dktqd76ih","published_at":"2026-10-09T01:41:27Z","review_id":"arr_v1_uw6eimkg4mfde4gtrfscf4vlt5","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"d1483798017a38d827ff59385684b1d52d591c0f","reviewer":"codex","start_line":110,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":771},"record_id":"art_v1_hl42j2ayinoj3aj7x27xbfcj3m","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-09T01:41:27Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
